ics"},{"text":"Excel"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Intermediate: Accounts and costing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clear CA Intermediate"},{"text":"Accounting standards and costing"},{"text":"Learn ERP basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Articleship: Hands-on"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Audit and accounting exposure"},{"text":"Learn the closing process at clients"},{"text":"Improve reporting skills"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final and career: Qualify and grow"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clear CA Final"},{"text":"Start as an accountant or reporting executive"},{"text":"Move to controllership in 5-8 years"}]}]},{"heading":"Essential Skills","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Type"],"rows":[[{"text":"Ind AS reporting"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Month-end close"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Budgets and MIS"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Internal controls"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Accuracy"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Deadline management"},{"text":"Professional"}]]}]},{"heading":"Tools and Technologies to Learn","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SAP / Oracle / Tally"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"}]}]},{"heading":"Internships and Practical Experience","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Articleship"},{"text":"Corporate finance internships"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications and Additional Training","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ind AS / IFRS certificate courses"},{"text":"SAP FICO (optional)"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Before you enrol","text":"Check the current syllabus, fees and eligibility on the certifying body's official website."}]},{"heading":"Higher Education Options in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Options after your degree:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA Finance (optional)"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Entrance exams and tests to know:"},